{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 07 · SCIENCE FAIR — the public face  ·  target 9 October 2026",
      "x": -1100,
      "y": -1150,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## SCIENCE FAIR\nDemonstrate only what has been **physically demonstrated**.\nA demonstrator that admits its limits beats one caught overstating them.\n[[07 - Science Fair/Science Fair.md]]",
      "x": -1100,
      "y": -1000,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PROJECT\n01 · Project HQ\nmission + non-negotiables",
      "x": 100,
      "y": -1000,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HARDWARE\n02 · Hardware Lab\nparts, buses, safety",
      "x": 720,
      "y": -1000,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FIRMWARE\n03 · Firmware Lab\nruntime + state machine",
      "x": 1340,
      "y": -1000,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## BACKEND\n04 · Backend Server Room\nAPI + SQLite",
      "x": 1960,
      "y": -1000,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## DEMO\npresentation/demo-script.md\n7 stages, every one has a fallback",
      "x": 100,
      "y": -740,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PRESENTATION\npresentation/outline.md\n3 min talk + ≤2 min demo",
      "x": 720,
      "y": -740,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## JUDGE Q&A\npresentation/judge-questions.md\n10 questions, answered honestly",
      "x": 1340,
      "y": -740,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## SETUP\ndocs/SCIENCE-FAIR-SETUP.md\npack, venue startup, recovery",
      "x": 1960,
      "y": -740,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Problem** — 30 s",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": -520,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Design** — 40 s",
      "x": -530,
      "y": -520,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Privacy** — 30 s",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": -410,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Build & experiment** — 40 s",
      "x": -530,
      "y": -410,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Results** — 30 s",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Limits & next** — 20 s",
      "x": -530,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Results slot: measured numbers **with** setup and sample size — or say “not measured”.",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": -190,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 50,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g018",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "THE DEMO  —  7 stages, each with a labelled fallback",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t019",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1 Start — power, health, date/time",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -520,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 92,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t020",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2 Enroll — synthetic student, two impressions",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": -520,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 92,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t021",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3 Scan — consenting adult, locate by UUID",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 92,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t022",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4 Duplicate — inside 60 s → DUPLICATE_SUPPRESSED",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 92,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t023",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5 Report — authorised daily aggregate / CSV",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -320,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 92,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t024",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6 Failure & recovery — outage, replay, reconcile once",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": -320,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 92,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t025",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "7 Close — state limitations, clear the template",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 92,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t026",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Today, stages 1–6 cannot be run** — stage 2 onward needs the R307S. That is not a reason to fake it. It is the reason the fallback exists.",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 2130,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "g027",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "THE THREE QUESTIONS THAT DECIDE IT",
      "x": -1100,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t028",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**“Where is the biometric data stored?”**\nDesign keeps capture/matching/templates inside the sensor; only a slot number leaves. Exact sensor capabilities are not independently verified. We do not claim templates are irreversible.",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t029",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**“What results have you measured?”**\nOnly dated results with setup, sample count and method. Accuracy, FAR/FRR, latency and reliability are **not measured**.",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t030",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**“Is this ready for schools?”**\nNo. HTTP bearer traffic is unencrypted, sensor spoof resistance is unknown, retention and compliance unresolved.",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "g031",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "EXPERIMENTS DEFINED IN ADVANCE  —  so results cannot be reverse-engineered",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t032",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Enrollment success**\nmeasure: successes / attempts\ncontrol: consenting adults; module firmware",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Recognition reliability**\nmeasure: genuine accept / reject; impostor\ncontrol: consent and safety protocol",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t034",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Response latency**\nmeasure: finger→feedback; commit→UI\ncontrol: ≥30 trials, p50/p95",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t035",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Duplicate boundary**\nmeasure: outcomes at 59 / 60 / 61 s\ncontrol: fixed synthetic identities",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t036",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Offline resilience**\nmeasure: queued UUIDs vs stored UUIDs\ncontrol: separate Wi-Fi and API loss",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t037",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Power interruption**\nmeasure: DB integrity, queue recovery\ncontrol: controlled removal only",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t038",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Backup recovery**\nmeasure: duration, integrity, row counts\ncontrol: separate restore destination",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t039",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Every one of these is currently “not measured.”**",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 2130,
      "height": 50,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "g040",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "TIMELINE  —  targets, not evidence",
      "x": -1100,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t041",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Sep 25**\nhardware order confirmed",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t042",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Sep 28**\nbench bring-up",
      "x": -918,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t043",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Oct 01**\nstandalone prototype",
      "x": -766,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t044",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Oct 04**\nfirst end-to-end demo",
      "x": -614,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t045",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Oct 06**\ntesting and code freeze",
      "x": -462,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t046",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Oct 08**\nbackup and rehearsal",
      "x": -310,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t047",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Oct 09**\nSCIENCE FAIR",
      "x": -158,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#be185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t048",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Canonical: `docs/science-fair-timeline.md`. Every presentation file already refuses to present a target as a result.",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
